<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Printable Home Blood Pressure Log | Vera Health Notes</title>
<meta name="description" content="Print a free one-page home blood pressure log with space for two readings per session and notes for your appointment.">
<link rel="canonical" href={new URL('/resources/blood-pressure-log/', Astro.site ?? Astro.url).href}>
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="Printable Home Blood Pressure Log | Vera Health Notes">
<meta property="og:description" content="A one-page US Letter worksheet for bringing home readings to your healthcare appointment.">
<style is:inline>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: #24362c;
  background: #f6f5f1;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 24px;
}
.sheet {
  background: white;
  max-width: 8.5in;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 35px;
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
}
header {
  border-bottom: 3px solid #254235;
  padding-bottom: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.brand {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: bold;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}
h1 {
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 32px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
p, li { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
.subtitle { color: #52645a; }
.fields {
  display: flex;
  gap: 25px;
  margin: 25px 0;
}
.fields div { flex: 1; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; padding-bottom: 18px; }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
th {
  background: #e8eee8;
  font-size: 10px;
  padding: 10px 5px;
  border: 1px solid #999;
}
td { height: 38px; border: 1px solid #999; }
.notes { border: 1px solid #aaa; height: 65px; margin-top: 10px; }
button {
  display: block;
  margin: 20px auto;
  padding: 12px 25px;
  background: #254235;
  color: white;
  border: 0;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.small { font-size: 10px; color: #555; }
.table-wrap { max-width: 100%; }
.screen-only { text-align: center; }
@media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
  body { padding: 12px; }
  .sheet { padding: 16px; }
  h1 { font-size: 27px; }
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { min-width: 500px; }
}
@media print {
  body { padding: 0; background: white; }
  .sheet { border: 0; padding: 0; }
  button, .screen-only { display: none; }
}

/* VHN PRINT OPTIMIZATION */
@media print {
  @page { size: letter; margin: 0.35in; }
  html, body {
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    background: white !important;
  }
  .sheet {
    max-width: none;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;
  }
  header { margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; }
  h1 { font-size: 25px; margin: 9px 0 5px; }
  h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 12px 0 7px; }
  p, li { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.3; }
  ul { margin: 6px 0; padding-left: 22px; }
  .fields { margin: 12px 0; gap: 15px; }
  .fields div { padding-bottom: 8px; font-size: 11px; }
  table { margin-top: 8px; }
  th { font-size: 8px; padding: 5px 3px; }
  td { height: 27px; }
  .notes { height: 48px; margin-top: 5px; }
  .small { font-size: 8px; line-height: 1.3; }
  button, .screen-only { display: none; }
  tr { break-inside: avoid; }
}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet">
<header>
<div class="brand">VERA HEALTH NOTES</div>
<h1>My Home Blood Pressure Log</h1>
<p class="subtitle">
A simple record to bring to your healthcare appointment.
</p>
</header>

<div class="fields">
<div>Name (optional):</div>
<div>Week of:</div>
</div>

<h2>How to use this sheet</h2>
<ul>
<li>Follow the monitoring instructions from your healthcare professional.</li>
<li>Use one row per session. Enter the time and both readings if taken.</li>
<li>Use the notes column for details you want to discuss at your appointment.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Record your readings</h2>
<div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Blood pressure log table">
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th scope="col">Date</th>
<th scope="col">Time</th>
<th scope="col">Reading 1<br>Systolic / Diastolic</th>
<th scope="col">Reading 2<br>Systolic / Diastolic</th>
<th scope="col">Pulse<br>(optional)</th>
<th scope="col">Notes</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>

<h2>Questions or notes for my appointment</h2>
<div class="notes"></div>

<p class="small">
<a href="https://www.heart.org/en/health-topics/high-blood-pressure/understanding-blood-pressure-readings/monitoring-your-blood-pressure-at-home">American Heart Association guide to home monitoring</a>.
For personal recordkeeping only. Not a diagnosis or medical advice.
Do not change prescribed treatment without consulting your healthcare professional.
</p>
<p class="small">
Vera Health Notes — Editorial draft. Pending final review.
</p>
</div>

<p class="screen-only"><a href="/">Vera Health Notes home</a></p>
<button type="button" onclick="window.print()">Print This Log</button>
</body>
</html>
